WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,770
To put it lightly

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:03,330
Love doesn’t cost you money

3
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:08,000
But don’t you all think that

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,600
My uncle is lucky

5
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,230
Is it because of that boat?

6
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:16,260
you want good luck

7
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,020
Not willing to spend money

8
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:23,010
There's no such thing as an idiot's lunch

9
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:25,680
I don’t know Song Laoqi either

10
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,120
What price will you give for that piece of shit?

11
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:30,940
Anyway, he doesn't care what price he gives

12
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:33,400
You just have to be more generous than him.

13
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:39,850
You kid is deliberately encouraging me to pay you a high price here.

14
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:41,010
Bury your brother-in-law's boat

15
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:45,890
tell me the truth

16
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:48,110
Song Laoqi is looking for your uncle

17
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:49,390
Do you really want to buy a boat?

18
00:00:49,910 --> 00:01:00,000
Do you believe in Su Yuan or not?

19
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,560
What did Zhang Jianjun do here just now?

20
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,520
What did you all talk about?

21
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,310
He suspected that Song Laoqi wanted to buy a boat and get married, so I told him

22
00:01:08,310 --> 00:01:09,870
Let him pay a high price to buy it from you

23
00:01:10,190 --> 00:01:15,280
I also said

24
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,080
That boat has Lord Dragon surrendering to him

25
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:18,480
Whoever buys it gets rich

26
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:21,980
You ghost, go home.
